/kd-develop/
/gt-develop/

# Build outputs (all subprojects)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
*.user
.vs/

# Large render outputs
**/_res96/
game-tools/korean-division-image-out/

# Python / tooling caches
__pycache__/
.claude/
ops/CARD_REGISTRY.md.lock
